      'Expert appraiser\'s ACV determination for motor vehicles is NONBINDING (unlike formal appraisal)',
      'Written demand triggers formal appraisal; 20 days for appraiser; 15 days for umpire',
      'Umpire selected by judge of court of record in the PARISH (not state) where loss occurred',
      'Award of any two determines loss amount',
      'Bad faith penalty: 50% of amount due OR $1,000 (whichever is greater) plus attorney fees for arbitrary/capricious failure to pay',
